# SBP (Supervisor Bootstrap Protocol) is a separate governance repository with
# its own remote: peteroluoch/supervisor-bootstrap-protocol. It is nested here
# for local use and is intentionally not part of this repository. Ignoring it
# prevents `git add -A` from writing a gitlink pointer into this repo's history.
sbp/
